 Group Inc 10-K FY2023", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/731766/000073176624000081/unh-20231231.htm", "truncated": false}, {"chunk_id": "UNH_10K_2023-12-31__risk_factors__0004", "ticker": "UNH", "form": "10-K", "fiscal_label": "FY2023", "period_end": "2023-12-31", "section": "risk_factors", "score": 1.3464, "filing_name": "UnitedHealth Group Inc 10-K FY2023", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/731766/000073176624000081/unh-20231231.htm", "truncated": false}, {"chunk_id": "UNH_10Q_2023-09-30__risk_factors__0000", "ticker": "UNH", "form": "10-Q", "fiscal_label": "Q3 FY2023", "period_end": "2023-09-30", "section": "risk_factors", "score": 1.2138, "filing_name": "UnitedHealth Group Inc 10-Q Q3 FY2023", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/731766/000073176623000064/unh-20230930.htm", "truncated": false}], "collapsed_near_duplicates": 33, "dropped_candidates": 143, "token_estimate": 31935, "gaps": ["UNH Q2 FY2025 10-Q: no filing text matched", "UNH Q1 FY2025 10-Q: no filing text matched", "UNH Q2 FY2024 10-Q: no filing text matched", "UNH Q1 FY2024 10-Q: no filing text matched", "UNH Q2 FY2023 10-Q: no filing text matched", "UNH Q1 FY2023 10-Q: no filing text matched"], "degraded": []}, "answer": {"direct_answer": "The 10-Qs in the context (Q3 fiscal 2023, ended September 30, 2023; Q3 fiscal 2024, ended September 30, 2024; Q3 fiscal 2025, ended September 30, 2025) each state no material changes to the risk factors in the prior 10-K [UNH_10Q_2023-09-30__risk_factors__0000] [UNH_10Q_2025-09-30__risk_factors__0000]. The fiscal 2024 10-K (ended December 31, 2024) is the first in the context to say Change Healthcare, which it had recently acquired, was subject to a cyberattack in 2024 [UNH_10K_2024-12-31__risk_factors__0005]. It also states that techniques to obtain unauthorized access are growing more sophisticated in part due to evolving AI/ML technologies, including generative AI [UNH_10K_2024-12-31__risk_factors__0005]. G